  "description": "Rest EndPoint Response REPR is a lightweight library that implements the Mediator design pattern in .NET.\n\t\t\t  It helps decouple the sender of a request from its handler, promoting cleaner architecture and separation of concerns.\n\t\t\t  Instead of calling services or logic directly, you send a request (like a command or query),\n\t\t\t  and REPR routes it to the appropriate handler.\n\t\t\t  GIT: https://github.com/tlavay/REPR",
  "id": "REPR",
